@baseUrl = https://ticketsystem.tobiashardo.dk
@token = indsæt token her
### Opret en demo-bruger (forvent 201; 409 hvis e-mailen findes)
# Brug kun dette demonstrationspassword til denne bruger.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo User",
  "email": "ticketdesk-demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo-Only-Password-2026!"
}

### Log ind (forvent 200), og kopiér token fra svaret til variablen ovenfor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ticketdesk-demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo-Only-Password-2026!"
}

### Hent egne tickets med token (forventet 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Samme request uden token (forventet 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Opret en ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kan ikke logge ind",
  "description": "Jeg får en fejl, når jeg prøver at logge ind.",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Opdater en ticket (forvent 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Loginproblem løst",
  "description": "Jeg kan nu logge ind igen.",
  "status": "CLOSED",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### USER må ikke tildele en supporter (forvent 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign?supporterId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Slet en ticket (forvent 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ADMIN opretter en supporter (forvent 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/supporters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Support",
  "email": "support-demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo-Support-2026!"
}

### Log ind (forvent 200), og kopiér token fra svaret til variablen ovenfor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "support-demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo-Support-2026!"
}

### ADMIN/SUPPORT tildeler supporter (forvent 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1/assign?supporterId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}